        "author_name": "William-Jefferson Mina",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115189723404507938804/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIu0-hHYiva5uPor00oO8CGfQB7XE9VWM6k2dvVtHwzA_HC4g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have been using Tanya Manno as my go to Inspector for all my buyers and has been amazing. Very transparent with the client and no hesitation whatsoever when questions are asked up front.",
        "time": 1737690040,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vanessa Di Francesco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110676568079358822209/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL2op8ar8b0iotwvhNcuCfJhTH1G37bQTAEWY0bATGxbssrhD41=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "DO NOT use inspector SLIM CHAMI from this service. Please be warned.\n\nThe single worst home inspector I have come across. He cost us the sale of our home by either intentionally lying about the condition of the home and saying there were major defects where there were none, or simply being so bad at his job that he really could not tell minor defects from major ones. As an example: he stated that our tar and gravel roof urgently needed to be redone. We later had a professional roofer and a second inspector say that the roof was fine. On other points, he grossly exaggerated: for example, a bit of rust on a window lintel from 1960 was listed as an urgent repair that had to be undertaken before the close of the inspection window. Again, we then consulted both a professional mason and a second inspector, who agreed this was absolutely not an urgent issue. He also caused damage to our property and then photographed it and added it to the report as a defect: I’m speaking specifically of a crack in the parging on the front exterior wall which was not there just before his inspection.\n\nNot only did he cost us our sale, but the unknowing buyers backed out of a house they seemingly very much wanted because they were led astray by his awful report.\n\nSTAY AWAY!",
        "time": 1721618313,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "jess robin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112561900208892806022/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWDU2TNrssg6MXzM0Ws4QYG3TFh2kRBKgJglPMN10BQorntv4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had an inspection today done by Danny Ménard.\nSuper professional, knowledgeable and kind.\nI left confident and with a binder full of information.\nI recommend their services .",
        "time": 1729284497,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hannah Pearson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104370893051598216689/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUla699K_OnuUgxMZrFeVodPli5zbsYjEy3h338kICGQGrUAqe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I just got out of an inspection for my first home with Serge and his associate. My husband and I are blown away at the quality of service and amount of time he took to explain every finding, issue and preventative measures for the future. Highly recommended to people who want affordability and quality.",
        "time": 1628889473,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "eva mohan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101122751560234978921/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUclEEHX8MsGS_3m4uLWHG4aLrdM8q-6w5KU4C_BhrXC5JUEKyHVg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Would not recommend - Marc André Brouillette inspected the home i was renting. He left the lights on, left the back gate open, left the basement door open, turned up all the heat and didn't turn it back down (it was a hot week in May!!!). Also, he failed to mention to his clients that there were squirrels and chipmunks living in the house, because I had to tell his client that.",
